{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 26, :comments ["<b>You shall not eat upon the blood; you shall not practice divination, nor soothsaying.</b> All these were practices among them for foretelling the future, turning aside from the ways of the spirit of purity and prophecy to the ways of the spirit of impurity. And since it is of the ways of fear of El and His honor not to defile the bodies of His people, whom He has sanctified to serve Him, He said [this]."], :book :leviticus, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 19, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:36:57.508939634Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}